          <span class="slogan-line"></span>
          <div class="slogan-text">
            <div class="slogan-ar">البجع ... رحلتك تبدأ معنا</div>
            <div class="slogan-en">ALBAJA ... YOUR JOURNEY BEGINS WITH US</div>
